 "description": "This planter features a bowl-like drip tray to give your plants proper drainage.\n\n**Supports**\nNone needed!\n\n**Scaling**\nCan be scaled however you like! Just make sure you scale the pot and the tray the same.\n\n**Orientation**\nThe planter and tray should have their bottoms on the build plate.\n\n**Print Settings**\n- .2mm layer height\n- 15% grid infill\n\nFilament and non 3D printed items for this model can be found on my Amazon Storefront, linked here: https://hendricks.design/links/",
